-l 	last page
-opw 	owner password (for encrypted files)
-subst 	show font substitutions
-upw 	user password (for encrypted files)
-v 	print copyright and version info
--- pdftocairo -antialias 
best 	prefer quality
default 	the target device's (default)
fast 	prefer speed
good 	balance quality and speed
gray 	shades of gray
none 	disabled
subpixel 	using the LCD's subpixels
